# Text Challenges

## Introduction

Text data collected from social media, chats, and messages is often messy and unstructured. It may contain slang words, emojis, spelling mistakes, abbreviations, and repeated characters. Before using this text for Natural Language Processing (NLP), preprocessing is required to clean and standardize the text.

