## Issues Identified

The sentences contain multiple problems such as slang words, emojis, spelling mistakes, repeated letters, and abbreviations. Words like "brooo", "gud", "plz" are slang. Emojis like 😂 🤣 👍 😊 are present. Some words contain typos such as "cmng", "assgnmnt", "mrng". Repeated characters like "sooo", "happpy" also appear. Short forms like "u", "r", "bcz" are used instead of proper words.

## Preprocessing Needed

To clean the text, the following preprocessing steps are required:

* Convert text to lowercase
* Remove punctuation
* Remove emojis
* Remove extra repeated characters
* Replace slang and abbreviations
* Remove stopwords
* Tokenize the text into words

## Conclusion

Text preprocessing improves data quality and makes it suitable for machine learning models. Clean text helps NLP systems understand meaning better and produce accurate results.
